<h3><u>Shabbir agar teri azadari na hoti</u></h3>
                <div style="width:100%">
                                <p><p>na dil rota na gham hota na aisa kahin matam hota<br />
shabbir agar teri azadari na hoti<br />
mazloom ki duniya may tarafdaari na hoti<br />
shabbir agar teri....</p>

<p>shabbir ka maqsad jo samajh leta zamana<br />
quran ko samjhne mayi ye dushwari na hoti<br />
shabbir agar teri....</p>

<p>kya fayeda aankhon ka reh jaata zara socho<br />
in aankhon may maula ki jo gham-khwari na hoti<br />
shabbir agar teri....</p>

<p>shabbir ke rozay pe kuch roz jo rehte<br />
tumko ko kabhi jannat ki talab-gari na hoti<br />
shabbir agar teri....</p>

<p>do roz bhi jannat may rehna hamay mushkil tha<br />
zehra tere bachon ki jo sardari na hoti<br />
shabbir agar teri....</p>

<p>ghazi tere jaisa jo alamdar na hota<br />
dunya may alam hote alamdari na hoti<br />
shabbir agar teri....</p>

<p>sharminda sakina se agar hota na pani<br />
yeh rasm sabilo ki kabi jaari na hoti<br />
shabbir agar teri....</p>

<p>namoos muhammad ko jo pehchanti dunya<br />
zainab ke khule sar pe ye sang baari na hoti<br />
shabbir agar teri....</p>

<p>jannat may qadam rakhte nahi sarwar-o-rehan<br />
jannat may jo maula ki azadari na hoti<br />
shabbir agar teri....</p>
</p>